[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2606341717","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101787#issuecomment-2606341717","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101787","id":2606341717,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bWZ5V","user":{"login":"Break-Ben","id":80194912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMTk0OTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80194912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben","html_url":"https://github.com/Break-Ben","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T05:38:27Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T05:38:27Z","body":"I've updated it so that the `FEATURE_NODE_DOCK` constant is still there and marked as deprecated with the new features added at the end.\r\n\r\nWhile I believe that it should be compatible now, it's definitely not ideal. To be honest, I don't have enough knowledge about feature profiles to propose a better solution to this (for example I assumed the order of the enum didn't matter since the integer values don't seem to be used other than in memory, but I guess that's not true), but if anyone else knows a better way this could be done, that would be great.\r\n![Screenshot 2025-01-22 131915](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8101d5a9-4bf3-40e2-bdc8-81af57aad15e)\r\nI can reopen the PR if it is decided that this implementation is fine or if a better one is decided on.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2606341717/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3505966432","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101787#issuecomment-3505966432","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101787","id":3505966432,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Q-M1g","user":{"login":"Break-Ben","id":80194912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMTk0OTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80194912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben","html_url":"https://github.com/Break-Ben","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-08T04:52:46Z","updated_at":"2025-11-08T04:52:46Z","body":"There were many merge conflicts with this PR, so I rewrote it from scratch, and it's now back to its previous functional state.\r\n\r\nTo reiterate, this PR is **fully functional**. The only unresolved concern I had was allowing it to work with feature profiles without breaking compatibility. My current solution, as shown in my last comment, simply marks the Node dock option as deprecated and adds the 2 new docks to the bottom of the list.\r\nIf this solution is acceptable, I will reopen the PR. If not, I would appreciate some help/advice with an alternate solution, as I can't personally think of a good alternative that doesn't break compatibility.\r\n\r\nWith all the other UI changes in 4.6, I would love to get this merged in time!\r\n\r\n_Also, apologies for leaving this PR dormant for so long - seemingly whenever I had free time, there was a feature freeze_","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3505966432/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3536757425","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101787#issuecomment-3536757425","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101787","id":3536757425,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SzqKx","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/p