lternative","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3537578311/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3547673992","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101787#issuecomment-3547673992","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101787","id":3547673992,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TdTWI","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T13:32:46Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T13:32:46Z","body":"The Group dock is not properly disabled when a Resource is selected and prints errors when toggling groups.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3547673992/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3550655351","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101787#issuecomment-3550655351","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101787","id":3550655351,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TorN3","user":{"login":"Break-Ben","id":80194912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMTk0OTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80194912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben","html_url":"https://github.com/Break-Ben","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-19T04:26:19Z","updated_at":"2025-11-19T04:26:19Z","body":"Thank you all for the reviews! I believe it should be all good now","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3550655351/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3559596218","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101787#issuecomment-3559596218","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101787","id":3559596218,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UKyC6","user":{"login":"KeyboardDanni","id":34800072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODAwMDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34800072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyboardDanni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-20T19:00:53Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T19:00:53Z","body":"This seems like a net positive to me.\r\n\r\nIt feels weird to have these views in tabs named \"Signals\" and \"Groups\" because now you don't have the context of them being properties of the selected Node. On the other hand I think it's weirder that we had multiple levels of tabs. At one point I had an editor layout saved with the Node tab open and focused on \"Groups\" which led to some confusion in the past whenever I loaded that layout. Because I don't use groups, this change means I can just close the Groups tab and remove some of the clutter.\r\n\r\nI do worry that this could create too many top-level tabs though. Right now I have Inspector, Node, Import, History as the four tabs in my right pane. This change would increase that to 5 were I to not close the Groups tab.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3559596218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3559773528","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101787#issuecomment-3559773528","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101787","id":3559773528,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ULdVY","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-20T19:49:10Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T19:49:10Z","body":"This also sounds good to me.\r\n\r\nIt does make me wonder if the \"Inspector\" tab should be named to something else, like \"Properties\". The word \"Inspector\" feels too all-encompassing to me, for something that only allows you to inspect _some_ aspects of a selected item, while other aspects are in separate tabs with more precise names. That being said, the term \"Inspector\" is no doubt used in lots of tutorials and resources, so changing it could cause confusion for newcomers...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3559773528/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3560483927","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101787#issuecomment-3560483927","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101787","id":3560483927,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UOKxX","user":{"login":"trickster721","id":2681169,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODExNjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2681169?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trickster721","html_url":"https://github.com/trickster721","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trickster721/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trickster721/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trickster721/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trickster721/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trickster721/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trickster721/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trickster721/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trickster721/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trickster721/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-20T22:54:57Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T22:54:57Z","body":"In my heart I want all the inspecting to happen in the inspector, but I can't find a way to argue with the logic of the separate docks, it just makes more sense.\r\n\r\nThe inspector has a slightly odd name, but that uniqueness helps make references to it clear and unambiguous. \"Properties\" is a technical term, it already refers to a separate idea. \"Change the property in the inspector\" makes more sense than \"change the property in the properties\". People would need to call it \"the properties tab\" for clarity. It's a more accurate description, but a less useful name.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3560483927/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3561419034","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101787#issuecomment-3561419034","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101787","id":3561419034,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7URvEa","user":{"login":"Break-Ben","id":80194912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMTk0OTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80194912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben","html_url":"https://github.com/Break-Ben","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Break-Ben/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-21T05:09:23Z","updated_at":"2025-11-21T05:09:23Z","body":"Fixed the new merge conflicts. Not exactly sure why the `select_a_node` label was moved out of node dock, as it now makes `signals_dock.cpp` and `groups_dock.cpp` very short, but I updated this PR to match it regardless.\r\n\r\nAlso, to touch on the reasoning, I understand that having an extra dock will take up more space, but I believe its benefits outweigh this, e.g.\r\n1. Strong level of customisation (you can rearrange the docks, hide some, show them all at once, etc)\r\n2. Consistency with the rest of the app/theming\r\n3. Eliminates the issue of sometimes needing multiple clicks to view signals/groups","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3561419034/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3562927125","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101787#issuecomment-3562927125","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101787","id":3562927125,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UXfQV","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-21T12:59:15Z","updated_at":"2025-11-21T12:59:15Z","body":"> Not exactly sure why the select_a_node label was moved out of node dock, as it now makes signals_dock.cpp